      "title": "J&K Chief Minister Omar Abdullah marries journalist Nidhi Razdan",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/jampk-cm-omar-abdullah-gets-married-to-journalist-nidhi-razdan/article71649156.ece",
      "description": "Posting the wedding pictures on X, Omar Abdullah said, ‘A new journey began yesterday’; Nidhi Razdan also posted pictures with a joyful message, “It’s done bro”",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-10-31T15:11:28"
    },
    {
      "title": "J-K CM Omar Abdullah marries journalist Nidhi Razdan in Srinagar",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/j-k-cm-omar-abdullah-marries-journalist-nidhi-razdan-in-srinagar-126103100897_1.html",
      "description": "Jammu and Kashmir Chief Minister Omar Abdullah has married television journalist Nidhi Razdan here.\nIn a tweet on Saturday, 56-year-old Omar said, \"a new journey began yesterday...\" and tagged Nidhi in it.\nThe tweet included four pictures of the couple.\nSources said the marriage was solemnised under the Special Marriage Act here on Friday.\nThe witnesses included family members from both sides.\nOmar's marriage to his first wife, Payal, was dissolved by an order of the Supreme Court in July this year after the two reached a settlement.\nThis is the second marriage for 49-year-old Nidhi.\nThe wedding functions in Srinagar and New Delhi were attended by families and close relatives from both sides.\nAbdullah's parents, Farooq Abdullah and Mollie, his three sisters, and other close relatives, as well as Nidhi's parents, veteran journalist M K Razdan and Sarla Razdan, attended the functions.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-31T12:00:55"
    }
  ]
